 "finalText": "All done. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n**`src/WinOptimizer/Core/Snapshot.cs`** — Added `public DateTime SavedAt { get; set; }` to the `Snapshot` class (used `set` instead of `init` so `SnapshotStore` can assign it after construction).\n\n**`src/WinOptimizer/Services/SnapshotStore.cs`** — `SaveSnapshot` now sets `snapshot.SavedAt = DateTime.UtcNow` before serializing. `LoadSnapshot` already deserializes with `JsonSerializer.Deserialize<Snapshot>`, so the value is read back automatically — no extra code needed.\n\n**`tests/WinOptimizer.Tests/SnapshotStoreTests.cs`** — Added `SaveSnapshot_Then_Load_HasSavedAtWithinAMinuteOfNow` which saves a snapshot, loads it back, and asserts `SavedAt` falls between `before` and `after + 1 minute`.\n\nBuild: **ok**. Tests: **31 passed, 0 failed**. No ViewModels were touched."
